{"id":"erschienen","lemma":"erschienen","pos":"adj","rank":3782,"glosses":["published, released"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/De-erschienen.ogg/De-erschienen.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er ist noch nicht erschienen.","en":"He hasn't appeared yet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756019","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"not yet"]]},{"text":"Der Mond ist schon erschienen.","en":"The moon is already out.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"moon"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"already"},null]},{"text":"Plötzlich erschienen drei Hunde vor uns.","en":"All of a sudden, three dogs appeared in front of us.","words":[{"g":"suddenly, abruptly"},null,{"g":"three (numerical value…"},{"g":"dog, hound","l":"Hund"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"}]},{"text":"Er ist nicht zum letzten Treffen erschienen.","en":"He didn't come to the last meeting.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"the last one","l":"Letzter"},{"g":"to meet"},null]},{"text":"Die Zeugen erschienen vor dem Richter.","en":"The witnesses appeared before the judge.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"witness","l":"Zeuge"},null,{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"judge"}]}]}